[gd_scene format=3]
; SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
; Copyright (C) 2026 Charles (opsroller) and Montezuma contributors
; Title wordmark "MONTEZUMA'S": Archivo (SIL OFL 1.1, fonts/OFL.txt; github.com/Omnibus-Type/Archivo,
; pinned commit 47d54ca1ebb14fd864695f1d39dc734f39017c33) at wght 800, wdth 112, open tracking,
; extruded 0.12 of the cap height, in burnished pale high-karat cast gold (silver-rich, metallic,
; polished faces, rougher sides) standing on a thin basalt plate with a lime-stucco rim.
; Transparent background. Output renders/title-wordmark.png, 1920x600 (rendered at 3840x1200).
; Render all stills in one launch (see render_all.tscn):
;   python3 design/keyart/gen/build.py
;   godot --editor --path design/keyart -- --bake-lightmaps=res://stage_studio.tscn,res://stage_plaza.tscn
;   godot --path design/keyart --write-movie /tmp/keyart/all.png --fixed-fps 1 --quit-after 16
;   python3 design/keyart/gen/finish.py /tmp/keyart/all00000015.png


